{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/a7f1880d8ae0c4bdb815264cecbd777d.avif?t=1774353681\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy forces have invaded in an attempt to seize the great knowledge and powerful artifacts of your civilization. Players take on the role of Souls summoned to protect the legacy of their ancestors. To join the fight, you bring to life the empty armor of the great warriors of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/64adbde2bfb3d3c92e8f4383c3f13e92.poster.avif?t=1774353681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/64adbde2bfb3d3c92e8f4383c3f13e92.webm?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/64adbde2bfb3d3c92e8f4383c3f13e92.mp4?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/8c81be5e36690c294bebcdc9e8d8e5fc.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/8c81be5e36690c294bebcdc9e8d8e5fc.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/ea26dc941ad549689414c5d3c9800de2.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/ea26dc941ad549689414c5d3c9800de2.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top-down roguelike for up to 6 players offers fast game sessions set across randomly generated locations. Players must defeat the invaders and defend their citadel. Discover new skills and spells, strengthen your Soul, and defeat the final bosses on every difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/e91b06cfd1761ffb86dda381e80e4024.poster.avif?t=1774353681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/e91b06cfd1761ffb86dda381e80e4024.webm?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/e91b06cfd1761ffb86dda381e80e4024.mp4?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/0499bc5e78cf8d606794df4489dd9926.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/0499bc5e78cf8d606794df4489dd9926.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Life Souls, there are no fixed character classes. Players can upgrade the core attributes of their Soul and freely combine spells and artifacts during each run, creating unique builds every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/9c39eefbfd14e152f98357d8bf648ddd.poster.avif?t=1774353681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/9c39eefbfd14e152f98357d8bf648ddd.webm?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/9c39eefbfd14e152f98357d8bf648ddd.mp4?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/af6fcac3fd39c17c6ef5ec2888456073.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/af6fcac3fd39c17c6ef5ec2888456073.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself solo, or join exciting cooperative sessions with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/7fbd38d7f7c724262cc2525f304fd516.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/7fbd38d7f7c724262cc2525f304fd516.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game in your personal Hub. Each run takes you through randomly changing locations where: Sanctuary is a place where players can select artifacts and spells that fit their combat style. Arenas are massive halls scattered with ancient books and marks of previous battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/bf4ee878a32befaddf3a8173cf4a4200.poster.avif?t=1774353681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/bf4ee878a32befaddf3a8173cf4a4200.webm?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/bf4ee878a32befaddf3a8173cf4a4200.mp4?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/2c98c097918c9dd11633bfe73edbdd9a.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/2c98c097918c9dd11633bfe73edbdd9a.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each session, powerful bosses will test your strength and skill on every difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/c07a8c14cf789e288d0735967337616a.poster.avif?t=1774353681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/c07a8c14cf789e288d0735967337616a.webm?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/c07a8c14cf789e288d0735967337616a.mp4?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/4fa4f55f3e98c0686a19d36a7f45c131.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/4fa4f55f3e98c0686a19d36a7f45c131.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. Every run makes you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\