rmor of the great warriors of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/64adbde2bfb3d3c92e8f4383c3f13e92.poster.avif?t=1774353681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/64adbde2bfb3d3c92e8f4383c3f13e92.webm?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/64adbde2bfb3d3c92e8f4383c3f13e92.mp4?t=1774353681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/8c81be5e36690c294bebcdc9e8d8e5fc.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/8c81be5e36690c294bebcdc9e8d8e5fc.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras/ea26dc941ad549689414c5d3c9800de2.avif?t=1774353681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665310/extras_big/ea26dc941ad549689414c5d3c9800de2.webp?t=1774353681 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top-down roguelike for up to 6 players offers fast game sessions set across randomly generated locations. Players must defeat the invaders and defend their citadel. Discover new skills and spells, strengthen your Soul, and defeat the final bosses on every difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.ak